WEBVTT

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:19.370
Life with an Ordinary Guy who Reincarnated into a

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:19.370
Total Fantasy Knockout

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:34.490
I... I really have to kill it?

00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:37.200
This adorable living thing?

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:39.240
There's no other choice. 
It's so that we can live.

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:42.320
You do it! Somewhere I can't see!

00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:45.200
It's also a bit of an experiment.

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:47.210
Wait!

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:56.220
Episode 8.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:56.220
A Guy Who Reincarnated as a Fantasy     .
Knockout and a Choice                           .

00:01:57.030 --> 00:01:59.240
I'm sorry, bunny.

00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:01.470
I can't eat meat today.

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:04.480
Oh, was that your first kill?

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:07.100
Eating your first kill is something
 really special, you know?

00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:09.540
Would you like to try it raw?

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:13.520
Someone says they can't eat meat, 
and you recommend it raw? Are you crazy?

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:16.360
Who is this guy anyway?

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:19.040
He seems kinda shady. Are you sure about him?

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:21.320
My, my. What a terrible estimation of me.

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:24.700
Please allow me to stay with you 
until we reach the royal capital.

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:28.390
My cart is broken and my 
crocodog ran away, after all.

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:27.850
Crocodog

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:31.130
My only means of transportation is walking.

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:33.210
And all alone...

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:36.990
I see. Since you broke it, 
we can't really argue.

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:37.990
Sorry.

00:02:37.990 --> 00:02:41.340
Since my charm doesn't work on him, 
I guess it's fine, but...

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:43.570
I'm Tachibana.

00:02:43.570 --> 00:02:44.850
I'm Jinguuji.

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:46.880
I'm called Shen.

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:51.030
You both have such unusual names. 
Where are you from?

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:53.270
We can't provide you our 
personal information.

00:02:53.990 --> 00:02:58.110
Since you were friendly with that elf, 
perhaps you're from the south?

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:00.280
Oh! I forgot about the premier!

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:02.810
You think it was okay to leave her behind?

00:03:02.810 --> 00:03:06.660
A woman who'd try for our lives at any 
opportunity? We couldn't bring her along.

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:11.550
This squid is delicious, but the god 
of your forest was pretty good, too.

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:13.320
That was your fault, wasn't it?

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:17.840
Tachibana                                  Strength
 
Hero                                          Power:  1

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:17.840
But why is it that only my Luck increases?

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:20.660
Your physical stats may not improve at all.

00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:21.510
What?

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:25.220
I have a rough understanding
 of how we level up.

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:29.520
After beating the first monster, I was the 
only one to gain experience points,

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:31.820
but even though the premier 
helped to kill the squid,

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:33.740
your level increased, too, right?

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:35.730
Now that you mention it, it did.

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:39.520
It's very likely that close contact 
is the key. That's my guess.

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:41.040
Close contact?

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:44.910
Is that why you made me 
kill that rabbit earlier?

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:46.680
You should explain stuff like that first!

00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:49.380
Even if I had, you still would've objected, right?

00:03:49.380 --> 00:03:51.370
I've finished making our meal.

00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:53.370
<i>Blast it...</i>

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:55.380
<i>It's so good!</i>

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:57.840
<i>The taste of this life...</i>

00:03:59.020 --> 00:04:03.280
<i>This guy's always killing stuff 
so we can eat.</i>

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:04.890
<i>That's really amazing.</i>

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:09.680
<i>Jinguuji's hands are really big.</i>

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:12.980
<i>No. Is it that mine are small?</i>

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:17.190
Thanks for the meal!

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:19.440
Toilet, toilet...

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:20.100
Huh?

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:25.420
Why are you following me?

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:25.820
Huh?

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.440
You might get abducted if
I take my eyes off of you, right?

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:30.080
But we're inside the apartment...

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:33.530
It was that kind of blithe disregard 
that brought about the last incident.

00:04:33.530 --> 00:04:35.360
I've decided I won't let down my guard again.

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:37.480
By which you mean that 
you're going to wait there?

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:38.140
Yes.

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:41.510
I can't feel comfortable 
with someone else there!

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:44.930
So this is your love nest?

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:47.430
No, I am a freeloader and no more.

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:51.170
Never mind, though. Since we're alone,
 this is the perfect time.

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:52.550
There's something I want to ask you.

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:53.180
What?

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:56.940
Why are you following us? 
Tell me your intentions.

00:04:56.940 --> 00:05:00.190
Shen                                              Strength
Trader                                           Power: 38
Gender: Male                               Speed: 60
Level: 52                                       Intelligence: 43
.                                                      Luck: 12

00:04:57.420 --> 00:04:59.350
Who are you really?

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:07.700
<i>If he were a townsperson, he should 
have skills relating to his trade.</i>

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:10.800
<i>Instead, of all things, 
he has Assassination Techniques?</i>

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:12.560
Active
Negotiation Skills Lvl 1
Perception Block Lvl 2
Assassination Techniques Lvl 2

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:12.200
<i>That's entirely too dangerous.</i>

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:15.710
<i>Depending on the circumstances, 
while Tachibana is out of the way...</i>

00:05:15.980 --> 00:05:19.210
I told you my intentions earlier, didn't I?

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:22.810
I would like you to allow 
me to accompany you.

00:05:22.810 --> 00:05:25.970
<i>It isn't bloodlust. What is 
this sense of pressure I feel?</i>

00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:29.100
<i>Is his target Tachibana after all?</i>

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:31.830
<i>She must look quite desirable 
to a slave trader.</i>

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:34.060
<i>But he hasn't breathed a word about her...</i>

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:36.230
<i>As I thought, he is no ordinary person!</i>

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:37.980
Please, wait!

00:05:38.460 --> 00:05:43.700
If I meant to harm you, I'd have 
put something in the food earlier.

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:51.500
And, well, I did put something in the stew.

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:53.160
Just a little something.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:54.660
<i>Blast it!</i>

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:57.460
So how are you feeling?

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:59.670
Your body must have started 
to heat up, right?

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:02.340
<i>Poison? Or some kind of drug?</i>

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:05.090
<i>Taking away our ability to move, and then...</i>

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:08.550
<i>I gave Tachibana a lecture, 
then let us get into this mess!</i>

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:11.560
<i>My head's feeling foggy. 
I can't think straight.</i>

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:12.850
<i>But...</i>

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:14.260
<i>I can move!</i>

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:15.720
<i>Which means...</i>

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:22.940
You will tell me your true objectives!

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:27.950
Why are you crying?

00:06:29.640 --> 00:06:33.700
Splendid. Your body is just 
as splendid as I'd imagined.

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:35.200
And so...

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:37.960
Shall we begin?

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:43.010
Ah, I feel better.

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:47.280
My, you are very strong, aren't you?

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:48.400
What are you doing?

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:49.840
Don't come any closer, Tachibana!

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:53.060
He drugged us.

00:06:53.060 --> 00:06:54.790
I'm having trouble moving.

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:55.840
What—?!

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:57.310
It's likely he's after you.

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:58.320
Run!

00:06:58.320 --> 00:07:00.640
Wh-What about you?

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:03.070
After you've escaped, 
I'll figure something out!

00:07:03.070 --> 00:07:03.810
But...

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:06.950
if we get separated, we may 
never see each other again!

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:10.700
You can worry about that... 
after you get to safety!

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:13.200
That desperate expression... Lovely...

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:15.600
I'm sorry, Jinguuji.

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:19.040
If I didn't have a body like this, 
we could've been together longer.

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:21.990
It's been like this ever since we got here.

00:07:21.990 --> 00:07:26.500
Because I'm this cute, I only 
ever cause trouble for you.

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:27.950
Tachibana...

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:30.010
No.

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:32.260
You're not particularly cute.

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:36.260
Tachibana-san, to me, 
you aren't cute in the slightest.

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:38.090
You don't suit my tastes at all.

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:42.400
I'm not targeting you, and I've never 
once thought of selling you as a slave,

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:43.770
so please don't worry.

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:46.520
What? But I am cute.

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:49.270
What's with you? 
You're a slave trader, right?

00:07:49.270 --> 00:07:51.210
Have your eyes rotted or something?

00:07:51.210 --> 00:07:53.680
It's your disposition 
that's rotten, isn't it?

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:54.240
What?!

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:55.410
Don't get caught up in it, idiot!

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:57.050
Just hurry up and run!

00:07:57.050 --> 00:08:00.540
My cuteness is my entire identity right now.

00:08:01.010 --> 00:08:03.200
If that's denied me, what do I have left?

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:06.170
You just said that your cuteness 
only caused trouble, and now this?!

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:11.010
<i>With Jinguuji unable to fight, I'm the 
only one who can do anything about this.</i>

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:15.050
You don't seem affected by 
my charm for some reason, but...

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:19.060
if I can make it work, then I win!

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:21.640
Not you!

00:08:22.620 --> 00:08:24.140
Seriously, what's with you?!

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:32.150
<b>menace 
menace 
menace 
menace</b>

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:32.150
<b>squish 
squish 
squish 
squish</b>

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:27.930
You seek to entice me with that 
soft, squishy body of yours?

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:31.160
How strange. It only makes 
hatred rise up within me.

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:32.150
What'd you say?

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:34.750
I'll show you how good softness can be!

00:08:34.750 --> 00:08:35.660
Stop!

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:39.660
If I see something like that 
when I'm not well, I'll die!

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:41.760
<i>Getting charmed on top of all this...</i>

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:44.500
<i>She's so cute. I can't...</i>

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:46.920
<i>Times like this call for...</i>

00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:48.200
<i>muscle!</i>

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:49.030
<i>A man!</i>

00:08:49.030 --> 00:08:51.300
<i>I will look at a man and calm down!</i>

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:54.610
Your partner has looked away...

00:08:54.610 --> 00:08:56.980
He can't maintain interest in the subject.

00:08:56.980 --> 00:08:58.930
I feel sorry for you, Tachibana-san.

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:02.840
As you can see, Jinguuji has chosen my body.

00:09:02.840 --> 00:09:03.600
Huh?

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:08.480
Doesn't that mean that right now,
 I'm more attractive than you?

00:09:09.180 --> 00:09:12.460
Normally, I'd be able to 
say it wasn't true, but...

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:15.190
We're talking about Jinguuji here!

00:09:15.190 --> 00:09:17.970
It's totally possible that 
he'd chose a male body!

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:19.700
What do you think I am?

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:23.450
Then choose, Jinguuji! To you...

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:26.460
which of us is more attractive?

00:09:26.720 --> 00:09:28.960
Come on! Come on!

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:30.970
S-Stop!

00:09:30.970 --> 00:09:32.150
My brain is trembling!

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:33.210
Don't run away, you!

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:35.980
Which of us is cuter? 
It's a simple question, right?

00:09:35.980 --> 00:09:40.220
You're asking which? No matter 
which I choose, I'm choosing a man!

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:43.470
...a man! ...a man!

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:44.640
Huh?

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:46.780
Tachibana-san, are you a man?

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:49.480
<i>Stare</i>

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:52.090
Wh-What?

00:09:53.010 --> 00:09:54.520
No, no way.

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:56.740
You're super rude, you know that?

00:09:57.040 --> 00:09:59.590
Why are you so squishy?

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:02.070
That body is a crime, you know? Seriously.

00:10:02.070 --> 00:10:07.250
I agree that it's a crime, but because 
of its cuteness, not its softness.

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:10.000
Your vanity is extreme as well.

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:11.540
It's fact.

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:14.850
Both of you... enough already...

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:17.770
Jinguuji!

00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:20.470
It appears he's finally reached his limit.

00:10:21.190 --> 00:10:24.430
Don't worry about me. Run!

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:28.940
A-All I've done is keep 
falling for his provocation!

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:33.300
<i>Blast it. If he's not interested in me, 
then why is he doing this?</i>

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:35.540
<i>Wait. He's not interested in me?</i>

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:37.480
Idiot!

00:10:37.480 --> 00:10:39.460
You're the one who needs to run, Jinguuji!

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:40.200
What?

00:10:40.470 --> 00:10:42.340
Shen's isn't after me!

00:10:42.340 --> 00:10:45.270
He's after you—!

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:47.950
Tachibana!

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:53.080
Now... Shall we begin?

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:54.460
Stop, Shen!

00:10:54.700 --> 00:10:58.880
You have to get consent before 
you do things like that!

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:05.470
<b>squeeze♥  squeeze♥  squeeze♥  squeeze♥  squeeze♥  squeeze♥</b>

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:08.480
<b>rub♥  rub♥  rub♥  rub♥</b>

00:11:08.760 --> 00:11:09.840
Tachibana?

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:11.970
What's happening to me right now?

00:11:11.970 --> 00:11:13.020
Torture?

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:14.360
No.

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:16.620
You're having your body loosened up.

00:11:16.620 --> 00:11:17.860
Loosened up?

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:22.650
The truth is, my family has knowledge 
of secret pressure points.

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:24.780
Secret pressure points?

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:29.000
I just couldn't turn away from this level 
of fatigue, I suppose you could say.

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:34.500
If I hadn't been this forceful, Jinguuji-san 
probably wouldn't let me treat him, would he?

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:37.040
Oh, what amazing muscles.

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:39.010
<b>rub♥  rub♥  rub♥  rub♥  
rub♥  rub♥  rub♥  rub♥</b>

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:39.010
Jinguuji, you...

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:40.760
were tired?

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:43.510
Me? Tired?

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:46.480
You're not young anymore. 
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:51.020
The drug effects are stronger 
the more fatigued you are, too.

00:11:51.280 --> 00:11:54.590
It was enough to knock you down. 
Please be more self-aware.

00:11:54.590 --> 00:11:57.790
Did you give me that drug, too?

00:11:57.790 --> 00:11:58.780
No.

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:01.680
I gave you a laxative.

00:12:01.680 --> 00:12:04.270
<i>No wonder everything came out so cleanly!</i>

00:12:08.180 --> 00:12:11.140
<i>I've been forbidden to come 
within a ten meter radius.</i>

00:12:12.310 --> 00:12:16.650
<i>But how was my true identity exposed?</i>

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:20.180
<i>No... it wasn't exposed.</i>

00:12:21.110 --> 00:12:23.100
<i>Perhaps he has a keen sense 
of a person's true nature.</i>

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:28.520
Well, this has come from an unusual place.

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:33.410
This is...

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:39.980
Life with an Ordinary Guy who Reincarnated into a Total Fantasy Knockout

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:39.980
<b>boom boom boom</b>

00:12:35.720 --> 00:12:38.470
Isn't this... a spoiler?

00:12:43.470 --> 00:12:44.780
Are you feeling better?

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:45.990
Impossibly good.

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:49.670
Shen really was skilled, huh?

00:12:49.670 --> 00:12:52.500
From now on, if we feel even a little tired,

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:54.450
let's make sure to take a break.

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:56.750
Tired, huh?

00:12:57.200 --> 00:13:00.460
<i>I've never seen this guy even catch a cold.</i>

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:04.020
<i>I guess it shows how much of 
a burden I'm putting on him.</i>

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:07.760
<i>At the very least, I need to 
be able to protect myself.</i>

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:08.780
I can see it.

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:15.010
So that's the royal capital, huh?

00:13:15.010 --> 00:13:16.850
It looks like there's an inspection.

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:19.450
It's because there was a war not long ago.

00:13:19.450 --> 00:13:20.860
Whoa! That scared me!

00:13:21.250 --> 00:13:23.230
I told you. Not closer than ten meters.

00:13:23.230 --> 00:13:25.110
I thought you might have some trouble.

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:27.900
You mean we can't get in?

00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:29.120
I don't know.

00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:32.800
I would be able to guide you in,

00:13:32.800 --> 00:13:36.300
but in return, I'd like to show 
you around the capital and things.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:41.880
Welcome to the royal capital, Ishurna.

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:45.260
Wow, the houses are made of stone!

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:47.880
I can guide you anywhere.

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:49.590
Are there any temples?

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:52.840
Well, the temple of the 
goddess of love and beauty...

00:13:52.840 --> 00:13:54.100
is over there.

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:55.990
Why a temple?

00:13:54.100 --> 00:14:02.610
<b><i>munch munch munch munch</i></b>

00:13:55.990 --> 00:13:58.800
If we can find the prophecy of the goddess,

00:13:58.800 --> 00:14:01.310
we might be able to find out a 
little regarding the Demon Lord.

00:14:01.310 --> 00:14:02.610
I see.

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:06.240
Welcome to the temple of the 
goddess of love and beauty.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:07.490
<i>Whoa, she's beautiful.</i>

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:09.780
<i>How can this be?! 
She's perfectly respectable!</i>

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:11.260
<i>Clean, tidy, polite.</i>

00:14:11.260 --> 00:14:13.870
<i>Not a single issue with her deportment!</i>

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:16.500
<i>This is a temple for the worship 
of that crappy goddess!</i>

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:21.870
<i>I had an image in my head of some 
kind of nighttime pool event, but...</i>

00:14:21.870 --> 00:14:24.500
You have a powerful imagination.

00:14:24.910 --> 00:14:27.260
Oh! Oh, my, my, my!

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:29.890
Might you possibly be 
hoping to join our faith?

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:32.390
<i>Oh, she smells so nice!</i>

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:34.630
I can tell with just one look!

00:14:34.630 --> 00:14:38.140
You are perfectly suited 
to serving our goddess!

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:40.320
Please, come right this way.

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:42.040
I-Is this okay?

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:44.270
For now, we need to think 
about getting inside.

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:46.650
I do have one more person accompanying me.

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:49.280
Don't trouble yourself about me.

00:14:51.560 --> 00:14:54.020
This place is beautiful.

00:14:54.020 --> 00:14:57.870
Our goddess rules over love and beauty.

00:14:57.870 --> 00:15:01.290
The temple must always be kept beautiful.

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:05.670
And the same goes for us, her believers.

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:08.920
First, you will change into 
the garb of our order.

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:11.800
Oh! I like that! Garb!

00:15:17.860 --> 00:15:20.560
No, um... Miss?

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:21.480
Yes?

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:24.250
This isn't clothing so much as underwear...

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:25.610
It is the garb of our order.

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:27.440
Actually, it's sort of just cloth, isn't it?

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:29.320
It is the garb of our order.

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:30.400
But this...

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:33.080
That is our official dress.

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:36.480
Only those wearing it are permitted
 to enter our place of worship.

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:38.160
U-Um...

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:40.210
Please call for me once you've changed.

00:15:42.760 --> 00:15:44.830
I-I...

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:48.600
Do I have to wear this even though it feels 
like I'll lose something by doing it?

00:15:48.600 --> 00:15:49.820
Tachibana.

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:52.200
You know what our objective 
in coming here is, right?

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:53.890
To gather information.

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:54.590
That's right.

00:15:54.980 --> 00:15:56.270
You can't be...

00:15:56.270 --> 00:15:57.470
Steel your nerve.

00:15:57.760 --> 00:15:59.220
I already have.

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:01.330
You're kidding me!

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:04.730
This thing... All kinds of things 
are gonna pop out! And you're...

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:14.130
Are you done, Tachibana?

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:16.460
I'm coming out.

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:18.030
Yeah.

00:16:22.140 --> 00:16:28.400
punch punch punch

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:24.080
Why aren't you wearing it?!

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:26.300
I'm wearing it under my suit!

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:28.380
Why aren't you wearing any clothes?

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:30.560
What? Did you trick me?!

00:16:30.560 --> 00:16:33.480
You think it's okay to do 
that just to humiliate me?!

00:16:33.480 --> 00:16:35.700
Just to see me in this micro-swimsuit?!

00:16:35.700 --> 00:16:37.640
Don't make me out to be the bad guy!

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:40.290
The priestess was wearing 
clothes, wasn't she?!

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:42.390
Now that you mention it...

00:16:43.130 --> 00:16:44.770
Have you finished changing?

00:16:46.120 --> 00:16:48.460
Oh, it suits you very well!

00:16:48.460 --> 00:16:50.030
And the gentleman...

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:53.830
I'm still a little reluctant 
to show so much skin.

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:55.980
Are you wearing it underneath?

00:16:55.980 --> 00:16:58.680
Well, as you're only observing 
today, that should be fine.

00:16:58.680 --> 00:17:00.160
That's fine?

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:03.170
Then I'd like something to drape over me!

00:17:03.170 --> 00:17:04.800
In that case, take my robe.

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:05.170
Huh?

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:07.130
Will it do?

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:09.570
<b>Eek</b>

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:14.240
Sh-Showing that much skin to someone 
you've just met is wrong, isn't it?

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:18.180
I understand. I was surprised 
when I first saw as well.

00:17:18.670 --> 00:17:22.360
It's quite all right! I am sure one day 
that feeling will turn to joy!

00:17:22.360 --> 00:17:24.180
How is that all right?!

00:17:24.930 --> 00:17:26.690
Now, let us go.

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:30.610
It is a sacred space,
 so please, no carelessness.

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:46.870
This is our place of worship.

00:17:47.140 --> 00:17:48.340
What do you think?

00:17:48.340 --> 00:17:51.880
Isn't it a splendidly holy sight?

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:56.130
It's as though the deities have 
come to play in the water.

00:17:57.190 --> 00:17:59.640
Tachibana. Would you mind...

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:02.050
if I made this building cease to exist?

00:18:02.050 --> 00:18:05.390
Calm down. It's actually just 
like you imagined, right?

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:08.290
A pool at night filled with 
revelers enjoying themselves.

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:11.840
It's like it's saying that my thoughts 
are on the same level as that goddess,

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:13.900
which infuriates me to 
the depths of my heart.

00:18:14.260 --> 00:18:16.770
I want to make it as though it 
never existed. I will do it!

00:18:16.770 --> 00:18:18.910
But it won't disappear from my memories.

00:18:19.350 --> 00:18:22.160
Well then, let's bring you into our faith.

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:25.660
Into the faith? But we only 
meant to observe today.

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:29.650
Don't worry. Just leave everything to me.

00:18:29.650 --> 00:18:31.490
You are exceptional.

00:18:31.490 --> 00:18:33.920
In this world, you could 
reach the highest heights.

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:36.170
Huh? Um, Miss...

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:38.340
So, please take off your clothes.

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:40.930
But earlier you said I didn't need to.

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:43.900
If you try it once, it will become addictive!

00:18:43.900 --> 00:18:47.060
Now, take it off. Let's take it off!

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:48.480
Take it off!

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:50.230
No! Stop it!

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:57.070
I feel like something important's 
been stolen from me.

00:18:57.440 --> 00:19:00.490
First, you must make the 
most of what you have!

00:19:00.760 --> 00:19:03.220
You must show even more of your lovely skin!

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:07.240
What's this? Why is that on your body?

00:19:07.240 --> 00:19:08.000
Huh?

00:19:08.400 --> 00:19:11.390
You... How could this be?

00:19:11.390 --> 00:19:13.500
Is there something wrong with my body?

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:17.320
The mark of our gracious 
goddess is on your body?

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:18.920
Oh, now that you mention it...

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:21.260
How wicked!

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:23.820
That isn't something 
you can do as a joke!

00:19:23.820 --> 00:19:27.840
A-And what happens if you've 
got this on your body?

00:19:27.840 --> 00:19:31.270
After a proper judgment, a whipping at best.

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:36.770
<b>roooooar</b>

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:34.200
At worst, you'll be sent to a prison island.

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:36.770
<i>I heard a scary word in there.</i>

00:19:36.770 --> 00:19:39.900
With such a criminal in here, 
the air will be tainted!

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:41.500
Hurry up and throw her out!

00:19:43.840 --> 00:19:44.800
Don't touch her.

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:46.240
Ow, ow, ow!

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:51.920
Listen, believers!

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:54.960
We did not want for this stupid seal 
to be carved into her body!

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:57.590
We didn't want it at all, 
but we had no choice!

00:19:57.840 --> 00:19:59.840
Stupid seal?

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:03.720
That crappy goddess's seal! 
Naturally, we'd refuse something like that!

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:05.600
C-Crappy goddess?

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:10.540
The moment I was handed these swim briefs, 
I should've knocked this temple down!

00:20:10.540 --> 00:20:11.820
You weren't wearing them?!

00:20:11.820 --> 00:20:13.440
Why would I wear them?!

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:16.360
Everyone, take up your weapons.

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:17.060
Yeah!

00:20:17.060 --> 00:20:21.010
They shall receive regrets and 
our goddess's love in spades!

00:20:21.010 --> 00:20:23.450
Their hate has gone from me to Jinguuji?

00:20:23.840 --> 00:20:27.190
You know if you live that way, 
you'll shorten your lifespan.

00:20:27.190 --> 00:20:30.130
It's more tiring trying 
to be considerate of you.

00:20:30.130 --> 00:20:30.700
And...

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:34.500
this is the kind of development I like.

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:35.460
Is it?

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:40.440
Wh-What's that?

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:42.080
Impressive. Magic, is it?

00:20:42.080 --> 00:20:45.120
That magic is meant for the 
conversion of heathens!

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:48.850
It won't come off until you declare love 
for our goddess with a true heart!

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:49.880
What?!

00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:52.600
Magic that seems designed for 
Jinguuji right off the bat?!

00:20:53.080 --> 00:20:56.640
Doesn't this world protect 
freedom of religion?

00:20:56.640 --> 00:21:00.110
As I thought, the religions of 
this medieval world are worthless.

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:05.110
Until you learn to respect for our goddess,
 we will continue your correction!

00:21:06.390 --> 00:21:08.120
It's like a lynch mob!

00:21:09.180 --> 00:21:11.270
That will never sprout.

00:21:11.270 --> 00:21:13.380
They didn't get to the lynching bit.

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:16.410
How... My chains...

00:21:16.410 --> 00:21:18.800
They weren't strong enough to be chains.

00:21:18.800 --> 00:21:20.030
It can't be...

00:21:20.910 --> 00:21:22.960
I will not allow this outrage to continue!

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:26.220
O Goddess, in your exalted seat, 
master of the long ears...

00:21:26.840 --> 00:21:28.720
Priestess!

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:31.650
Come on! If you think you can 
fire at me, go ahead and fire!

00:21:31.650 --> 00:21:33.470
You seem like you're having fun.

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:37.900
We did not come here to 
spill blood unnecessarily.

00:21:40.680 --> 00:21:44.280
We wish to inspect the prophecy.

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:45.860
The prophecy?

00:21:46.120 --> 00:21:48.120
What would a heathen want with that?

00:21:48.120 --> 00:21:50.490
Because these honored people

00:21:50.780 --> 00:21:54.750
are heroes summoned here by the goddess.

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:56.750
You are...

00:21:57.120 --> 00:21:59.000
Hear me, believers!

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:01.500
Interfering with them is forbidden!

00:22:01.980 --> 00:22:03.830
This is a royal command!

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:08.720
<b>with</b>

00:23:35.750 --> 00:23:37.190
Believers.

00:23:37.190 --> 00:23:40.780
We shall not turn our backs on the teachings 
of the goddess of love and beauty.

00:23:40.780 --> 00:23:41.960
We will bare our bodies—

00:23:42.460 --> 00:23:43.620
That crappy goddess!

00:23:43.350 --> 00:23:49.990
<b>Episode 9 

00:23:43.620 --> 00:23:45.640
As I thought, she teaches nothing worthwhile!

00:23:45.640 --> 00:23:47.650
You! You have appeared once more!
